      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The default Linux filesystem: journaled, extent-based, battle-tested.",
      "source_hash": 13580104342768355337,
      "context_hash": 6662665463633864805,
      "translation": "Linux의 기본 파일시스템으로, 저널링과 extent 기반 구조를 갖추었으며 충분히 검증되었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:02.733594Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Developed by Theodore Ts'o, Andreas Dilger, Alex Tomas, and others; merged as stable in Linux 2.6.28.",
      "source_hash": 17626632405918077685,
      "context_hash": 5654620035852289600,
      "translation": "Theodore Ts'o, Andreas Dilger, Alex Tomas 등이 개발했으며, Linux 2.6.28에서 안정 버전으로 병합되었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:02.733594Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "On-disk layout",
      "source_hash": 6649632076020806245,
      "context_hash": 7079059090007129128,
      "translation": "온디스크 레이아웃",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:02.733595Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "An ext4 filesystem is divided into **block groups**.",
      "source_hash": 1799922296507152272,
      "context_hash": 9011788239199763635,
      "translation": "ext4 파일시스템은 **블록 그룹**(block group)으로 나뉩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:02.733595Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Each block group contains:",
      "source_hash": 4512467778809820855,
      "context_hash": 2162280213618215436,
      "translation": "각 블록 그룹에는 다음이 포함됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:02.733595Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The ext4 superblock",
      "source_hash": 1623717173618754231,
      "context_hash": 10418996714069126127,
      "translation": "ext4 슈퍼블록",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:02.733595Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The ext4 inode",
      "source_hash": 14193873862736759776,
      "context_hash": 5604466575707298351,
      "translation": "ext4 inode",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "inode": "inode"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:02.733595Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Extent tree: efficient large file representation",
      "source_hash": 1486445066743665323,
      "context_hash": 2684610373243590226,
      "translation": "Extent 트리: 대용량 파일의 효율적인 표현",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:02.733596Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "ext4 uses extents (contiguous block runs) instead of the old indirect block maps.",
      "source_hash": 299481278755798443,
      "context_hash": 17829183066066830271,
      "translation": "ext4는 기존의 간접 블록 맵 대신 extent(연속된 블록 구간)를 사용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:02.733596Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Extents were introduced by Alex Tomas [(commit)](https://git.kernel.org/linus/a86c61812637c7dd0c57e29880cffd477b62f2e7):",
      "source_hash": 17408089223741944505,
      "context_hash": 17518696495860756879,
      "translation": "Extent는 Alex Tomas가 도입했습니다 [(커밋)](https://git.kernel.org/linus/a86c61812637c7dd0c57e29880cffd477b62f2e7):",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:02.733596Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Benefits over old indirect maps:",
      "source_hash": 12743408038893793029,
      "context_hash": 18354006569501698823,
      "translation": "기존 간접 맵 대비 장점:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:02.733596Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "A single extent covers contiguous blocks (e.g., 128MB in one entry)",
      "source_hash": 5123970539307185768,
      "context_hash": 12038309408945007647,
      "translation": "하나의 extent가 연속된 블록을 표현함(예: 항목 하나로 128MB)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:02.733597Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Sequential reads are contiguous on disk → fast",
      "source_hash": 260062392326813491,
      "context_hash": 9347344944619123374,
      "translation": "순차 읽기가 디스크상에서 연속적임 → 빠름",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:02.733597Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Reduces inode tree depth for large files",
      "source_hash": 14507994446715711424,
      "context_hash": 9183636546637372964,
      "translation": "대용량 파일의 inode 트리 깊이 감소",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "inode": "inode"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:02.733597Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Journaling with jbd2",
      "source_hash": 17639076336032056224,
      "context_hash": 12922927741499396112,
      "translation": "jbd2를 이용한 저널링",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:02.733597Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "ext4 uses the Journal Block Device (jbd2) for crash consistency:",
      "source_hash": 16237072080272329059,
      "context_hash": 12224345165572136471,
      "translation": "ext4는 크래시 일관성을 위해 저널 블록 디바이스(Journal Block Device, jbd2)를 사용합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "block device": "블록 디바이스",
        "journal": "저널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:26:01.278313Z",
      "issues": []
    },
