      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Small writes that are quickly deleted never need block allocation",
      "source_hash": 22265798166333473,
      "context_hash": 8439250895380886460,
      "translation": "금방 삭제되는 작은 쓰기는 블록 할당이 전혀 필요하지 않습니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:48:49.954735Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Large sequential writes get contiguous blocks (better for extent efficiency)",
      "source_hash": 2293620919936090396,
      "context_hash": 8724140395661173421,
      "translation": "대용량 순차 쓰기는 연속된 블록을 할당받습니다(extent 효율성에 유리합니다)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:48:49.954735Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Reduces journal pressure (allocations batched)",
      "source_hash": 12455386359085404065,
      "context_hash": 6121547711177930336,
